WEBVTT

00:15.390 --> 00:16.850
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

01:54.197 --> 01:56.157
Is there a ship for us, too?

02:05.250 --> 02:06.918
What is that ship and who is on it?

02:07.877 --> 02:10.964
Military commanders
and high officials of Dongnae.

02:12.006 --> 02:13.675
They all left on that ship.

02:13.925 --> 02:15.635
They didn't even clean up the bodies.

02:15.802 --> 02:17.011
Once the sun sets,

02:18.805 --> 02:20.265
they will wake up again.

02:23.893 --> 02:24.894
Is there another ship?

02:24.978 --> 02:28.314
They all burned down last night.
That was the only ship left.

02:28.773 --> 02:31.693
We must find a place for these people
to hide before sunset.

02:32.569 --> 02:34.362
What about the barracks
from last night?

02:34.445 --> 02:36.447
We can keep all these people safe there.

02:36.823 --> 02:40.994
Well, they tore down the fence
to repair that ship.

02:43.496 --> 02:44.998
We can go to Jiyulheon.

02:45.415 --> 02:48.209
The infected were unable to get out
of there for several days,

02:49.252 --> 02:50.879
so they won't be able to get in.

02:55.758 --> 02:58.553
We will go to Jiyulheon.
Anyone who can walk, will walk.

02:58.928 --> 03:01.181
The old and the sick will be carried
on wagons.

03:03.308 --> 03:04.517
Everyone, hurry!

03:05.143 --> 03:06.269
We will go to Jiyulheon!

03:08.021 --> 03:09.147
Move quickly!

03:09.230 --> 03:12.358
We must get there before the sun sets,
so please hurry!

03:19.908 --> 03:20.909
We shall go, too.

03:41.763 --> 03:43.389
Oh, no.

03:45.475 --> 03:46.768
Are you hurt?

03:48.978 --> 03:50.855
- What's wrong?
- Over there.

03:51.022 --> 03:52.857
There is something weird over there.

03:53.524 --> 03:55.318
Wait, what is that?

03:59.405 --> 04:00.448
It's a monster!

04:03.451 --> 04:05.578
- Monsters everywhere.
- There's one there!

04:07.205 --> 04:08.122
Over there, too.

04:09.749 --> 04:10.667
Your Royal Highness.

04:12.043 --> 04:13.795
If we consider the ones hiding,

04:14.212 --> 04:15.838
they will be in great numbers.

04:24.013 --> 04:24.889
Run!

04:24.973 --> 04:26.766
Run! Now!

04:26.849 --> 04:27.684
Run!

04:28.226 --> 04:30.103
Run to Jiyulheon without stopping!

04:33.147 --> 04:34.565
Run and don't stop!

04:34.649 --> 04:35.608
Hurry!

04:35.692 --> 04:37.610
- Get on this, sir.
- Hurry!

04:42.615 --> 04:43.574
We must go.

04:48.955 --> 04:49.789
Your Highness!

04:53.042 --> 04:54.252
Help him!

04:55.503 --> 04:56.337
Push!

05:35.001 --> 05:36.377
Search the premises.

05:37.003 --> 05:38.463
Shut the gate once the sun sets!

05:42.008 --> 05:43.301
Go inside.

06:15.541 --> 06:16.667
Your Royal Highness!

06:18.669 --> 06:19.837
Help them over there!

06:19.921 --> 06:21.798
Your Royal Highness! Are you okay?

06:34.977 --> 06:36.104
Your Royal Highness!

06:38.398 --> 06:39.649
You must go.

06:39.857 --> 06:41.150
They're starting to wake up.

06:51.744 --> 06:53.037
Your Royal Highness.

06:53.704 --> 06:55.456
What are you doing? Push!

06:56.290 --> 06:58.835
Your Royal Highness, we don't have time.

06:58.918 --> 06:59.877
You must go!

06:59.961 --> 07:00.878
I'm different!

07:01.462 --> 07:04.173
I'm different from those
who abandoned these people,

07:04.257 --> 07:06.509
and I'm different
from the Haewon Cho Clan!

07:06.884 --> 07:11.013
I will never abandon these people!

07:20.565 --> 07:21.774
Get them on!

07:22.275 --> 07:24.277
- Hurry up!
- Hurry. Get on.

07:26.946 --> 07:28.114
Hurry!

07:31.951 --> 07:32.910
Get on!

07:45.506 --> 07:46.757
Run!

08:34.889 --> 08:37.099
- Where's the other wagon?
- I don't know!

08:57.328 --> 08:58.329
Monster ahead!

10:07.690 --> 10:10.151
- Prepare to close the gate!
- They're coming!

10:39.680 --> 10:41.223
Hurry! Run!

10:44.810 --> 10:47.021
Close the gate!

11:04.872 --> 11:05.873
Are you all right?

11:09.377 --> 11:11.504
The elderly and children
will hide in the shed,

11:11.962 --> 11:13.923
and anyone who can fight, grab a weapon!

11:14.006 --> 11:15.174
Yes, Your Royal Highness!

11:21.639 --> 11:24.058
Come this way! This way.

11:43.911 --> 11:45.663
How long until we arrive in Sangju?

11:46.622 --> 11:51.502
Well, since the weather is nice,
we should arrive in two days.

11:53.295 --> 11:55.005
Are you sure it's safe there?

11:56.882 --> 12:00.094
Sangju is the second largest city
after Hanyang,

12:00.177 --> 12:02.471
and it's filled with soldiers
who will protect us.

12:02.555 --> 12:04.014
Don't worry.

12:09.812 --> 12:10.980
What was that sound?

12:24.452 --> 12:25.828
My son.

12:26.203 --> 12:27.538
My precious son...

12:28.122 --> 12:29.498
My son...

12:33.836 --> 12:34.920
Hey, who...

12:35.671 --> 12:38.007
- Hey, shine the light over there.
- Okay.

12:47.975 --> 12:49.143
Is someone down there?

12:52.146 --> 12:54.565
Monster! There's a monster!

12:56.484 --> 12:57.568
Help!

14:36.625 --> 14:37.751
It's the sun.

14:39.336 --> 14:40.921
The sun is up, Your Royal Highness.

14:58.439 --> 14:59.440
Your Royal Highness.

15:00.149 --> 15:01.650
The monsters are going away.

15:12.995 --> 15:14.288
They are all gone!

15:30.596 --> 15:33.140
They are all gone. You can come out.

15:35.059 --> 15:36.435
Seo-bi.

15:50.783 --> 15:51.909
Your Royal Highness.

15:52.493 --> 15:54.244
May I come in?

15:58.624 --> 15:59.625
Come in.

16:04.088 --> 16:05.923
I think you should come out.

16:20.229 --> 16:22.856
Thank you, Your Royal Highness.

16:23.107 --> 16:26.777
Thank you for saving us!

16:26.860 --> 16:29.113
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

16:47.214 --> 16:50.676
Treat the wounds
and prepare some food to eat.

16:51.802 --> 16:52.845
Yes, Your Highness.

17:00.686 --> 17:01.937
All done.

17:03.605 --> 17:04.815
Here.

17:18.120 --> 17:21.707
- Don't use your right hand for a while.
- Okay. Thank you.

17:29.173 --> 17:31.216
Is that all there is
for the people to eat?

17:33.927 --> 17:36.221
Even that is difficult to obtain.

17:36.305 --> 17:39.266
It was hard enough with the war,
but they were taxed hard, too.

17:39.349 --> 17:40.893
How could they have food?

17:40.976 --> 17:43.520
I heard they ate anything living,
even insects.

17:48.650 --> 17:49.485
Your Highness.

17:52.780 --> 17:54.073
Bring those children to me.

17:56.033 --> 17:56.992
Your Royal Highness.

18:01.663 --> 18:02.498
You kids!

18:03.499 --> 18:04.458
Come here.

18:06.126 --> 18:07.377
Get over here!

18:14.676 --> 18:15.761
Your Royal Highness.

18:16.428 --> 18:21.141
We deserve to be killed for what we did.

18:33.195 --> 18:35.197
What is this?

18:35.280 --> 18:36.657
It's food.

18:52.339 --> 18:53.257
Now, go on and play.

19:02.558 --> 19:03.976
Give this to them.

19:05.227 --> 19:06.854
- Your Royal Highness.
- I am fine.

19:06.937 --> 19:08.313
I am sick of it anyway.

19:15.779 --> 19:17.573
Everyone, gather round.

19:17.823 --> 19:18.740
Gather round.

19:20.409 --> 19:22.202
This is from the Crown Prince.

19:22.786 --> 19:23.912
What is this?

19:24.788 --> 19:26.081
It's meat.

19:26.165 --> 19:28.333
- Meat? This is meat?
- Meat?

19:28.417 --> 19:29.543
This is meat!

19:29.626 --> 19:31.461
Thank you, Your Royal Highness.

19:32.254 --> 19:34.173
- It's meat!
- It really is meat.

19:34.298 --> 19:35.799
How do we eat this?

19:35.883 --> 19:38.719
- Make some soup with this.
- Is this really meat?

19:54.359 --> 19:56.653
Look! It got bigger!

20:05.704 --> 20:07.080
They are happy with the food.

20:09.458 --> 20:10.667
What will you do now?

20:10.751 --> 20:12.794
I will go to Lord Ahn Hyeon in Sangju.

20:21.220 --> 20:22.054
What is it?

20:22.137 --> 20:23.555
I am from Sangju.

20:24.598 --> 20:27.768
If you wish to go to Sangju,
I will be your guide.

20:28.769 --> 20:29.811
How can we trust you?

20:30.729 --> 20:32.022
Who are you, exactly?

20:33.690 --> 20:35.025
I'm merely one of the people.

20:35.108 --> 20:38.028
Then how do you know how to shoot a gun?

20:40.322 --> 20:42.032
I learned while serving in the war.

20:42.115 --> 20:45.118
You shot a monster right in the forehead
as it charged at you.

20:46.870 --> 20:49.164
Your skills are better than most soldiers.

20:50.540 --> 20:51.625
Who are you?

21:15.232 --> 21:17.734
What is it? Are they the ones
who attacked us yesterday?

21:18.068 --> 21:19.945
- What do we do?
- It must be them!

21:24.950 --> 21:28.870
Traitor Lee Chang, the Crown Prince,
must hear this!

21:31.999 --> 21:35.377
"The criminal, who must be transferred
to Hanyang for investigation,

21:36.253 --> 21:40.674
defied the King's command
and killed the commander of the Royal Army

21:40.966 --> 21:42.634
who came to arrest him.

21:43.218 --> 21:44.094
This crime...

21:44.761 --> 21:48.724
committed by the Crown Prince,
who must uphold the nation's laws,

21:48.849 --> 21:52.686
is an unforgivable act of treason!

21:54.104 --> 21:56.189
The traitor who defied the King's command

21:56.690 --> 22:00.360
must come out voluntarily and be bound!

22:02.070 --> 22:04.698
If you don't come out voluntarily
right this instant,

22:05.657 --> 22:08.368
it will be considered a defiance
against the King's command,

22:08.577 --> 22:11.538
and thus, you will be punished
severely by the law!"

22:11.621 --> 22:13.123
What is he talking about?

22:13.206 --> 22:15.167
Did they just say he is a traitor?

22:15.751 --> 22:18.879
They must be seriously mistaken.

22:18.962 --> 22:22.758
- Right.
- You should go and talk to them.

22:24.718 --> 22:26.636
Your Royal Highness, let me handle it.

22:28.096 --> 22:29.181
Chief!

22:29.264 --> 22:31.183
I, the Crown Prince's guard,
will come out!

22:51.870 --> 22:53.955
Your Majesty's son

22:56.875 --> 22:58.752
killed my son.

23:00.045 --> 23:02.089
I will do the same to him.

23:05.050 --> 23:06.301
No.

23:07.511 --> 23:09.304
I will be merciless

23:11.681 --> 23:13.183
and kill him brutally.

23:25.737 --> 23:27.030
Your Royal Highness!

23:48.969 --> 23:51.888
Your Royal Highness! It's dangerous! Run!

23:53.306 --> 23:54.307
Your Royal Highness!

23:55.392 --> 23:56.977
You must flee!

23:57.060 --> 23:58.019
Your Royal Highness!

24:14.202 --> 24:16.329
Your Royal Highness. Are you okay?

24:25.589 --> 24:27.048
It's my fault.

24:27.883 --> 24:29.551
- Because of me...
- That is correct.

24:29.634 --> 24:31.511
- This is all because of you.
- Shut up!

24:31.595 --> 24:33.889
If we are to survive, you must step up!

24:33.972 --> 24:35.182
- Shut up!
- Otherwise,

24:35.265 --> 24:36.808
we will all die!

25:41.039 --> 25:42.582
They have a gun!

26:02.394 --> 26:04.104
Gun squad, come with me.

26:04.896 --> 26:06.273
The rest of you, stand guard.

26:18.285 --> 26:19.452
They have one gun.

26:20.537 --> 26:22.330
- Have them march in.
- Yes, sir.

27:31.399 --> 27:32.651
At the entrance.

27:37.781 --> 27:39.115
Search the area!

27:39.616 --> 27:40.700
He has been shot.

27:44.704 --> 27:45.872
That way!

28:31.876 --> 28:32.836
Now!

28:33.128 --> 28:34.170
Come on out!

28:36.756 --> 28:38.341
It's dangerous for you to stay.

28:38.466 --> 28:41.010
Go to Yangsan before the sun sets. Hurry!

29:46.493 --> 29:47.660
To the south.

29:56.878 --> 29:57.879
To the west!

30:18.566 --> 30:19.526
We were fooled.

30:22.403 --> 30:23.446
It was the guard.

30:24.572 --> 30:27.200
He knew our signals and led us astray.

30:46.886 --> 30:48.847
Bring the horses. We must chase them.

30:48.930 --> 30:49.889
It's too late.

30:51.307 --> 30:52.725
No need to rush.

30:52.851 --> 30:54.185
Won't you chase them?

30:55.770 --> 30:56.855
There is no need.

30:58.356 --> 31:00.567
I know where they are heading to.

31:08.074 --> 31:10.285
SANGJU, AHN HYEON

31:18.626 --> 31:19.794
- Report it.
- Yes, sir.

31:21.212 --> 31:22.839
The signal fire has been lit!

31:25.633 --> 31:28.678
HANYANG

31:31.306 --> 31:32.849
The signal fire...

31:33.391 --> 31:34.767
The signal fire has been lit.

31:38.521 --> 31:41.608
I heard that the signal fire is lit.
Will there be a war?

31:41.816 --> 31:43.401
Did Japan invade again?

31:43.484 --> 31:45.612
Nothing has been confirmed yet.

31:45.695 --> 31:47.363
We must gather the troops.

31:47.447 --> 31:50.325
We must act before they march into Hanyang
like last time.

31:50.700 --> 31:52.452
I must see His Majesty.

31:53.953 --> 31:55.371
What do you mean?

31:55.955 --> 31:58.416
The signal fire is burning high
up on Cheoncheonryeong.

31:58.499 --> 32:00.460
Our nation is in peril.

32:00.793 --> 32:02.378
We cannot waste a single second.

32:02.879 --> 32:04.255
I'll go to the King's palace.

32:05.381 --> 32:06.424
But...

32:07.467 --> 32:09.218
I agree with Chief Scholar.

32:09.302 --> 32:10.929
I must see His Majesty as well.

32:11.137 --> 32:12.263
But...

32:12.347 --> 32:13.890
Minister, where are you going?

32:13.973 --> 32:15.600
He is going to the King's palace.

32:15.683 --> 32:17.560
- The King's palace?
- Yes.

32:18.728 --> 32:21.189
My lord, wait for us.

32:28.947 --> 32:29.989
Step aside.

32:30.281 --> 32:31.950
I must speak with His Majesty.

32:32.033 --> 32:34.202
We were ordered not to let outsiders in.

32:34.285 --> 32:35.995
How dare you!

32:36.245 --> 32:38.289
Do you not know who we are?

32:39.916 --> 32:41.084
Step back!

32:41.793 --> 32:44.462
How dare you draw your sword at us?

32:44.837 --> 32:46.297
Step aside!

32:46.756 --> 32:50.635
How dare you!
Are you that desperate to see His Majesty?

32:51.052 --> 32:54.013
My lord, I tried to stop them.

32:54.597 --> 32:55.848
You should see His Majesty.

32:55.932 --> 32:59.477
You all are core officials
who lead this nation.

32:59.560 --> 33:00.895
Step aside.

33:02.271 --> 33:04.482
Let us go see His Majesty together.

33:39.142 --> 33:40.685
What do you think you are doing?

33:45.440 --> 33:48.693
Your Majesty,
the signal fire has been lit.

33:49.152 --> 33:51.654
We must see His Majesty
and fix the situation.

33:51.738 --> 33:53.698
Please withdraw your command.

33:56.993 --> 33:58.619
Even if it's an emergency,

33:58.703 --> 34:01.622
how could you barge in like this
when His Majesty is gravely ill?

34:02.874 --> 34:04.083
Please step aside.

34:05.835 --> 34:08.671
We cannot hide
His Majesty's illness any longer.

34:08.755 --> 34:09.839
Father!

34:12.467 --> 34:14.260
Why are you doing this?

34:16.012 --> 34:17.388
We shall go inside.

34:17.889 --> 34:19.015
What are you doing?

34:19.390 --> 34:21.100
Show them out!

34:24.937 --> 34:25.938
Step aside.

34:29.901 --> 34:31.319
Announce us.

34:35.615 --> 34:38.451
Your Majesty, Chief State Councillor
is here to see you.

34:41.245 --> 34:44.207
The sun will set soon.

35:13.694 --> 35:17.240
I think His Majesty is asleep.

35:22.286 --> 35:25.373
His Majesty will wake up soon.
Have a seat.

35:30.711 --> 35:32.046
Come this way.

35:33.589 --> 35:37.343
You have not seen him in a while.
You should see him up close.

35:44.350 --> 35:45.726
Raise the blinds.

36:05.037 --> 36:09.250
Do you know why the signal fire
has been lit from the south?

36:09.792 --> 36:12.003
It's neither due to an invasion
nor a war.

36:13.045 --> 36:15.006
A disease has spread.

36:15.506 --> 36:17.466
It's a scary disease
that makes one sleep

36:17.717 --> 36:20.636
when the sun rises and crave
the flesh and blood of living people

36:21.804 --> 36:23.681
when the sun sets.

36:58.925 --> 37:00.635
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

37:00.718 --> 37:04.805
- Please be healthy and live a long life!
- Please be healthy and live a long life!

37:28.162 --> 37:29.580
Look carefully.

37:31.207 --> 37:32.792
This is the King of Joseon,

37:32.875 --> 37:36.295
the father of the tens
of thousands of subjects of the land.

37:39.257 --> 37:41.801
Is this why court ladies' corpses
are carried out daily?

37:41.968 --> 37:43.761
Is it all because of this disease?

37:44.387 --> 37:45.721
What if I say it's?

37:46.722 --> 37:49.809
If he lost his mind due to an illness
and craved human flesh,

37:50.351 --> 37:51.978
is he no longer the King?

37:53.020 --> 37:56.065
If he is not the King, who is he?

37:56.857 --> 37:58.276
He is alive, as you can see.

37:58.359 --> 38:00.736
Do you deny that he is the King?

38:04.240 --> 38:06.701
Is that why you lured
the Crown Prince and scholars

38:08.077 --> 38:10.162
and schemed rebellion

38:11.497 --> 38:13.291
to steal the King's throne?

38:16.877 --> 38:19.130
Lord Cho, what do you...

38:22.508 --> 38:25.761
Although His Majesty
contracted a grave disease,

38:27.054 --> 38:28.806
he is still the King of Joseon

38:28.889 --> 38:31.183
and the lord of the people.

38:32.435 --> 38:35.271
For rebelling against His Majesty
and coveting the throne,

38:35.604 --> 38:37.189
your family should be annihilated.

38:37.773 --> 38:40.526
Arrest Chief Scholar Kim Sun immediately
and behead him.

38:40.693 --> 38:42.862
As for Prince Lee Chang,
who fled to the south,

38:43.571 --> 38:45.114
he shall be deposed

38:46.115 --> 38:48.451
and poisoned to death.

38:50.911 --> 38:54.957
Palace guards, take the criminal Kim Sun
to the Royal Investigation Bureau!

39:46.175 --> 39:50.179
We will begin Chief Scholar Kim Sun's
interrogation!

39:57.978 --> 39:59.730
Since when did you plan all of this?

40:02.942 --> 40:06.487
You should have discussed it with me
if you planned to do something like this.

40:10.324 --> 40:12.243
I may be your daughter,

40:12.868 --> 40:14.412
but I'm the mother of this nation.

40:29.927 --> 40:31.846
I will kill them all.

40:32.471 --> 40:33.681
Every single one of them.

40:36.267 --> 40:40.271
I will kill the Crown Prince, who killed
my son, and everyone who follows him

40:42.857 --> 40:44.483
without any mercy.

40:45.192 --> 40:47.236
I will not forgive anyone

40:48.320 --> 40:50.114
who gets in my way.

40:52.032 --> 40:53.075
So,

40:54.952 --> 40:56.579
don't dare to stop me...

40:57.580 --> 40:59.123
ever again.

41:01.500 --> 41:03.752
I did not put you where you are now

41:06.046 --> 41:08.507
so that you can get in my way.

41:12.052 --> 41:13.429
Give birth to a son.

41:15.431 --> 41:17.224
It has to be a son.

41:19.643 --> 41:21.979
That is what you must do.

41:23.397 --> 41:24.857
Don't worry, Father.

41:25.357 --> 41:28.527
I will give birth to a son

41:29.320 --> 41:32.072
who will succeed Beom-il
in the Haewon Cho Clan...

41:35.367 --> 41:37.411
and inherit the throne.

45:41.697 --> 45:43.866
Subtitle translation by Jeong Lee
